<title>USA: Bowne to post $20 mln gain from unit sale.</title>
<headline>Bowne to post $20 mln gain from unit sale.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bowne &amp; Co Inc said Wednesday that it expects to post an after-tax gain of more than $20 million from the sale of its Baseline Financial Services Inc unit to Primark Corp.</p>
<p>The $40 million cash acquisition was announced earlier today. The deal is expected to be consummated within 30 days.</p>
<p>Bowne said Robert Patterson, Baseline's founder, will retain a 10 percent stake in the unit and will continue to manage the company under its new ownership.</p>
<p>Baseline provides data and information products for investment managers.</p>
</text>
